<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33891" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλμινς</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			Hp.
			<u>Morb.</u>
			4.54
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ινθος</span>, ἡ,
		dat. pl. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλμινσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Choerob.
					<u>in Theod.</u>
					1.299
				</span></i>
			:—also nom. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλμις</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				602b26
			</span></i>; acc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλμιθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					4.952.10
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i>; nom. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλμεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					<u>Eup.</u>
					2.67
				</span></i>
			; dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλμῑσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					3.180
				</span></i>
			: also gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλμιγγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.26
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιβ́</span>:—<i>worm</i>,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>intestinal-worm</i>, either flat (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλατεῖα</span>) or round (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρογγύλη</span>),
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				4.54
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prog.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				551a8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.12.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>parasitic worm</i> in sponges, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				548b15
			</span></i>.</div>
